  note    = {PMID 30838380. Grades induction risk by organism: avoid expanded-spectrum third-generation cephalosporins for the organisms at greatest risk, best described for Enterobacter cloacae; the likelihood of induction by other Enterobacteriaceae is less clear. This grading is what analysis/ampc_exposure.py implements},
